  "design_notes": "Shine reads in silhouette as a wide floating billboard: a 2.2 m magenta screen frame flanked by gold speaker cubes, crowned by a bulb-lit marquee, with two big detached block hands hovering out at the sides for wild game-show gestures. Everything about the shape faces outward to an audience: the giant screen is the face, the speakers broadcast, and the gold trim around the screen frames it like a stage. The body is held up by nothing but a stack of teal hover rings over a small glowing pad, so its whole existence visibly floats on the crowd's attention. The magenta and gold showbiz palette pops hard against Gridhaven's steel blue and concrete grey. Its bright white screen glow makes it the warmest light in Main Square, while the teal under-glow ties it to the city's signal lamps."
}